# Netlify SPA fallback: the viewer is a client-side-routed Vite SPA. Without
# these rewrites every deep link (/view/:id, /embed/:id, /view3d/:id) hits a
# server-side 404 at the Netlify edge and the tour never loads. The SPA's own
# routes render the proper "Tour not found"/"Tour not available" states for
# invalid ids.
/view/*      /index.html  200
/embed/*     /index.html  200
/view3d/*    /index.html  200
